.el .ds Aq '
.TH import 1  "import " 
.SH NAME
import \- Import local coding\-agent history into RestFlow sessions
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBimport\fR [\fB\-\-path\fR] [\fB\-\-dry\-run\fR] [\fB\-\-force\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fISOURCE\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Import local coding\-agent history into RestFlow sessions
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-path\fR \fI<PATH>\fR
Override the source root path for a single\-source import
.TP
\fB\-\-dry\-run\fR
Only report what would be imported
.TP
\fB\-\-force\fR
Overwrite existing RestFlow session JSONL files with the same id
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
[\fISOURCE\fR] [default: all]
Source history to import
.br

.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
all
.IP \(bu 2
claude
.IP \(bu 2
codex
.IP \(bu 2
opencode
.RE
